"""The tests of the live updates (ADR 0051): the events of the changes of the records.

The HTTP client of the other tests gives a response only at its end, so
these tests read the stream of `GET /live` from the ASGI messages of the
app. The changes use the sessions of the app, whose broker sends the
events after each commit.
"""

